{"id":"vdwvivq01d5vjzicae1d9jbam","title":"从 GitHub 迁移到 Codeberg 的经历","originalTitle":"Migrating from GitHub to Codeberg","summary":"作者于 2009 年创建 GitHub 账号，2023 年将 Inko 项目和个人项目迁回 GitHub，旨在增加项目可见度和贡献者数量。然而，由于 GitHub 上低质量的“贡献”增多，作者决定迁移至 Codeberg，因其对非自由软件的立场、反对 AI 和更符合自由软件精神的组织结构。迁移过程中，作者手动处理了 70 多个仓库，遇到 GitHub API 限流等问题，但最终顺利完成。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://yorickpeterse.com/articles/migrating-from-github-to-codeberg/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T05:10:34.395Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:31.634Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:31.634Z","category":"dev-tools","tags":["新项目","版本发布","架构重构","性能提升"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}